    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3043860/extras/893fc796a75652d12328675beb46ab56.poster.avif?t=1748635763\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3043860/extras/893fc796a75652d12328675beb46ab56.webm?t=1748635763\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3043860/extras/893fc796a75652d12328675beb46ab56.mp4?t=1748635763\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Imprint</i> is a single-player puzzle and adventure game with a strong vaporwave aesthetic; when Chloe agrees to take part in her father\u2019s experiment, she finds herself suddenly trapped within a decaying family computer. As her father works to get her out, she must carefully navigate files and programs, solving logical puzzles and trying to stay ahead of the corruption that is consuming everything around her.\u00a0</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>FEATURES</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience a deep emotional storyline, as Chloe explores a mysterious family history through old photo albums and abandoned side-projects. Who were these people? What happened to them?</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Follow Chloe\u2019s father\u2019s guidance through the strange digital world; he can only contact you in small bursts, but he is doing his best to set you free!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gorgeous vaporwave aesthetic; pink sunsets over endless horizons; angular geometric landscapes; retro arcades. Lovely and uncanny.\u00a0</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Puzzles and exploration bring challenge and discovery; solve puzzles in binary and hexidecimal; use color-codes to craft the right key for the right lock; carefully collect items and determine their use. Think like a machine in order to survive.\u00a0</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>OUTRUN THE CORRUPTION CONSUMING THE WORLD</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3043860/extras/02e8ca20830490700c0f6ea3dd562930.poster.avif?t=1748635763\" width=600 height=276 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3043860/extras/02e8ca20830490700c0f6ea3dd562930.webm?t=1748635763\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3043860/extras/02e8ca20830490700c0f6ea3dd562930.mp4?t=1748635763\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This mysterious computer is beginning to decay. The world is falling apart around you\u2013 corrupted files, missing data. Stay one step ahead, solving puzzles and moving from one place to the next as the story unfolds, and your father desperately works to save you. The world is full of hidden patterns, from color-codes to snippets of binary to chains of logic to secret messages. Only your sharp mind and careful eye can get you through.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>UNRAVEL THE MACHINE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3043860/extras/879cb6669cb0b4a554a35b537b58cf61.poster.avif?t=1748635763\" width=600 height=276 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3043860/extras/879cb6669cb0b4a554a35b537b58cf61.webm?t=1748635763\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3043860/extras/879cb6669cb0b4a554a35b537b58cf61.mp4?t=1748635763\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Who did this computer belong to? What happened to them? How did this world even get created in the first place? Why is it falling apart? Explore broken memories, walk through long-forgotten photo-albums and abandoned game-prototypes\u2013 and piece together the truth; this is the only way to escape.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3043860/extras/893fc796a75652d12328675beb46ab56.poster.avif?t=1748635763\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3043860/extras/893fc796a75652d12328675beb46ab56.webm?t=1748635763\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3043860/extras/893fc796a75652d12328675beb46ab56.mp4?t=1748635763\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Imprint</i> is a single-player puzzle and adventure game with a strong vaporwave aesthetic; when Chloe agrees to take part in her father\u2019s experiment, she finds herself suddenly trapped within a decaying family computer. As her father works to get her out, she must carefully navigate files and programs, solving logical puzzles and trying to stay ahead of the corruption that is consuming everything around her.\u00a0</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>FEATURES</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience a deep emotional storyline, as Chloe explores a mysterious family history through old photo albums and abandoned side-projects. Who were these people? What happened to them?</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Follow Chloe\u2019s father\u2019s guidance through the strange digital world; he can only contact you in small bursts, but he is doing his best to set you free!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gorgeous vaporwave aesthetic; pink sunsets over endless horizons; angular geometric landscapes; retro arcades. Lovely and uncanny.\u00a0</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Puzzles and exploration bring challenge and discovery; solve puzzles in binary and hexidecimal; use color-codes to craft the right key for the right lock; carefully collect items and determine their use. Think like a machine in order to survive.\u00a0</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>OUTRUN THE CORRUPTION CONSUMING THE WORLD</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3043860/extras/02e8ca20830490700c0f6ea3dd562930.poster.avif?t=1748635763\" width=600 height=276 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3043860/extras/02e8ca20830490700c0f6ea3dd562930.webm?t=1748635763\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3043860/extras/02e8ca20830490700c0f6ea3dd562930.mp4?t=1748635763\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This mysterious computer is beginning to decay. The world is falling apart around you\u2013 corrupted files, missing data. Stay one step ahead, solving puzzles and moving from one place to the next as the story unfolds, and your father desperately works to save you. The world is full of hidden patterns, from color-codes to snippets of binary to chains of logic to secret messages. Only your sharp mind and careful eye can get you through.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>UNRAVEL THE MACHINE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3043860/extras/879cb6669cb0b4a554a35b537b58cf61.poster.avif?t=1748635763\" width=600 height=276 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3043860/extras/879cb6669cb0b4a554a35b537b58cf61.webm?t=1748635763\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3043860/extras/879cb6669cb0b4a554a35b537b58cf61.mp4?t=1748635763\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Who did this computer belong to? What happened to them? How did this world even get created in the first place? Why is it falling apart? Explore broken memories, walk through long-forgotten photo-albums and abandoned game-prototypes\u2013 and piece together the truth; this is the only way to escape.</p>",
    "short_description": "Imprint is an atmospheric adventure which traps you inside a decaying family computer. Navigate forgotten photo albums and abandoned programs from the past. Solve puzzles in binary and hexadecimal; think like the machine. Can you find your way out? Or will you be trapped forever in the files?",
